<title>HONG KONG: People's Bank of China sets US$100 mln loan.</title>
<headline>People's Bank of China sets US$100 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The People's Bank of China's US$100 million loan was now in general syndication, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER PEOPLE'S BANK OF CHINA    TYPE    ADB CO-FINANCING</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN    (A) US$45 MLN   (B) US$55 MLN</p>
<p> MARGIN   (A) 6ML+30BP</p>
<p>	    (B) 6ML+30BP (YR 1-4), 40BP (YR 5-10), 50BP (YR 11-15)</p>
<p> MATURITY (A) 9.5 YRS  (B) 15 YRS</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE			   CALLS    NONE</p>
<p> AVAIL    A &amp; B 48 MTHS (A) MUST BE FULLY DRAWN BEFORE (B) IS</p>
<p>	    DRAWN</p>
<p>REPAYMENT (A) 12 SEMI-ANNUAL EQUAL INSTALMENTS  ( 4 YRS GRACE)</p>
<p>	     (B) 11 SEMI-ANNUAL EQUAL INSTALMENTS  (10 YRS GRACE)</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA			 GOV LAW  ENGLISH</p>
<p>ARRANGERS DKB HONG KONG AND HONGKONG BANK CHINA SERVICES</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     ARRANGERS	 US$10 MLN+  (A) 18 BP   (B) 56 BP</p>
<p>	     LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN+   (A) 13 BP   (B) 48 BP</p>
<p>	     MANAGERS	  US$3 MLN+   (A)  8 BP   (B) 40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     PROCEEDS ARE TO BE USED FOR A NEW POWER PLANT IN</p>
<p>	     CHINA'S CENTRAL HENAN PROVINCE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
